      <abstract id="pf.Summary">
        <title>Summary</title>
        <p>The purpose of this overview is to:</p>
        <p><list list-type="order"><list-item><label>1</label><p>Briefly describe the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="pf.Clinical_Characteristics_of_Pulmonary">clinical characteristics</xref> of pulmonary fibrosis.</p></list-item><list-item><label>2</label><p>Review genetic <xref ref-type="sec" rid="pf.Genetic_Causes_of_Pulmonary_Fibrosis">causes</xref> of pulmonary fibrosis.</p></list-item><list-item><label>3</label><p>Review the <xref ref-type="sec" rid="pf.Differential_Diagnosis_of_Pulmonary_F">differential diagnosis</xref> of pulmonary fibrosis.</p></list-item><list-item><label>4</label><p>Provide an <xref ref-type="sec" rid="pf.Evaluation_Strategies_to_Identify_the">evaluation strategy</xref> to identify the genetic cause of pulmonary fibrosis in a proband.</p></list-item><list-item><label>5</label><p>Review <xref ref-type="sec" rid="pf.Management_of_Pulmonary_Fibrosis">management</xref> of pulmonary fibrosis.</p></list-item><list-item><label>6</label><p>Inform <xref ref-type="sec" rid="pf.Genetic_Counseling">genetic counseling</xref> of family members of an individual with a genetic predisposition to pulmonary fibrosis.</p></list-item></list>
</p>
      </abstract>
